-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party runtime dependencies
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

The studio bundles a Pyodide runtime and pure-Python wheels (rdflib, pyshacl,
owlrl and their dependencies) under web/static/pyodide/. Each carries its own
licence inside its distribution; none is relicensed here.

Vocabulary frequency tables derived from third-party annotation releases (GQA,
Visual Genome, PSG) are staged under docs/eval/vocab/ and are held from
publication pending a licence review. docs/eval/attribution.md states exactly
what was taken from each and where the licence position could not be
established.
